{
	"name": "Burn Bright",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/fire/flame-burning-skull-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 3rd level, you gain the ability to expend two hit dice as a bonus action to add an additional dice of damage to a damaging cantrip you cast with your action. When you do so, roll 2d8 and take the result as damage that cannot be mitigated.</p><p>You may instead choose to gain a level of Fatigue or Strife to instead gain two additional dice of damage on a cantrip you cast with your action. Any additional damage dice are of the same size and type as the cantrip normally gains.</p>",
